┌─ REQUEST FLOW (tylluan_do) ─────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  Client sends intent                                        │
│       │                                                     │
│       ▼                                                     │
│  handler_do/routing.rs                                      │
│    1. catalog lookup (trigger_phrases BM25)                 │
│    2. if no hit → BGE-M3 embed → cosine similarity         │
│    3. guild selected (score threshold 0.6)                  │
│       │                                                     │
│       ▼                                                     │
│  M20 Complexity Cascade                                     │
│    score ≥ 0.6 → coordinator proactively                   │
│    score ≥ 0.4 + guild fails → coordinator fallback        │
│       │                                                     │
│       ▼                                                     │
│  registry.call_tool(guild, tool, args)                      │
│    → guild subprocess receives stdio JSON                   │
│    → result returned to client                              │
│                                                              │
│  Timeouts (NEVER LOWER — CPU inference):                    │
│    system_guild_ms  = 15000                                 │
│    analysis_guild_ms = 60000                                │
│    heavy_guild_ms   = 180000                                │
│    tool_call_secs   = 3600                                  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ MEMORY FLOW (tylluan_remember / tylluan_recall) ───────────┐
│                                                              │
│  WRITE (tylluan_remember):                                  │
│    content → silva/mod.rs → embed (BGE-M3)                 │
│    → SilvaDB INSERT node (text + vector + metadata)        │
│    → extract triples → graph edges                         │
│    → query_embed_cache.invalidate()                        │
│                                                             │
│  READ (tylluan_recall):                                     │
│    query → query_embed_cache.get_or_embed()                │
│    cache HIT  → skip ONNX (300s TTL)                       │
│    cache MISS → BGE-M3 ONNX → store in cache              │
│    → BM25 (FTS5) + vector cosine → RRF merge              │
│    → LinearRAG degree penalty                               │
│    → Jina reranker → top-N results                         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ GUILD LIFECYCLE ───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  ALWAYS-ON guilds (tylluan.toml always_on):                 │
│    main.rs → registry.spawn_always_on() on startup         │
│    supervisor.rs → checks every 10s                        │
│    crash → backoff 1s,2s,4s → after 3 fails: DEGRADED     │
│    degraded → logged ONCE then silenced (no spam)          │
│                                                              │
│  LAZY guilds (on first call):                               │
│    first request → registry.ensure_guild_running()         │
│    spawns Python subprocess with fastmcp stdio             │
│    stays alive until idle timeout (300s default)           │
│                                                              │
│  CRITICAL: guild_process.rs load() MUST NOT restore        │
│    always_on or crash_count from registry.json             │
│    main.rs re-applies always_on from config after load()   │
│    crash_count resets to 0 on every boot                   │
│                                                              │
│  SCHEDULER GUILD special:                                   │
│    In always_on: yes (tylluan.toml line 57)                │
│    scheduler.py starts background thread on import         │
│    THEN serves MCP via if __name__ == "__main__" block     │
│    Without entry point → process exits → crash loop        │
│    Fixed: commit dcbff04 (2026-07-07)                      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

