┌─ ERROR RECOVERY ────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  Guild crash loop:                                          │
│    1. Check guild_process.rs: does load() restore always_on?│
│    2. Check guild .py: does it have if __name__ entry point?│
│    3. Delete registry.json → fresh load from tylluan.toml   │
│    4. Rebuild binary after any Rust fix                     │
│                                                              │
│  Two kernels running (SQLite corruption risk):              │
│    taskkill /IM tylluan-nexus.exe /F  (kills ALL)          │
│    then restart clean with .\tylluan-mcp.bat               │
│                                                              │
│  Binary stale (changes not in binary):                      │
│    tylluan-mcp.bat prefers target\release\                  │
│    delete release binary to force debug:                    │
│      del target\release\tylluan-nexus.exe                   │
│    or rebuild release:                                      │
│      cargo build --release -p tylluan-kernel               │
│                                                              │
│  Kernel down after benchmark:                               │
│    Antigravity stops kernel after tests — normal.           │
│    Restart: .\tylluan-mcp.bat                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
